ero. ","The resulting linear system (18 equations, 18 unknowns) is solved by Gaussian elimination with partial pivoting. Hover over any member in the diagram to see its exact tension or compression force. The maximum chord force (0 kN) and maximum diagonal force (0 kN) are now the actual peak member forces, not deep-beam approximations."]]]]]]],[[4,20]],[[4,21]],[[4,22]],[[4,23]],[[4,24]],[[4,25]],[[4,26]],[[4,27]]]],"viewport":{"width":1000,"height":900},"timestamp":389695.332,"wallTime":1790654281277,"collectionTime":28.799999999813735,"resourceOverrides":[],"isMainFrame":true}}
